Package: viewos-kwin-effect
Source: viewos
Version: 0.1.0
Section: kde
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: ViewOS Project <help@jmultimate.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/Mitchell-Brooke/viewos
Depends:
 kwin-common (>= 4:6.0),
 libkwin6,
 libkf6configcore6,
 libkf6coreaddons6,
 libkf6windowsystem6,
 libqt6core6t64,
 libqt6gui6,
 libstdc++6,
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Recommends: viewos-face-daemon
Description: KWin effect for ViewOS face-tracked window perspective
 ViewOS can rotate each window in 3D so that it faces the position of the
 viewer's head, using a webcam, the physical dimensions of the screen, and
 the geometry of the viewing frustum.
 .
 This package provides the KWin compositor effect that applies those
 transforms. It receives head-pose updates from viewos-face-daemon over a
 local Unix socket and applies them to eligible windows, leaving fullscreen,
 maximised, dialog and other excluded windows untouched.
 .
 The effect is inert unless viewos-face-daemon is running.
